(text "ISOLATED BOM/FOOTPRINT STUDY. No electrical net changes from reviewed correction.\nExact parts and official land pattern now specified; effective C/ESR/hot leakage/thermal gates OPEN.\n31.6k load floor requires total resistance error <=1%; see bounded drift budget.\nBYP-OUT10nF: ~0.66ms initial ramp, ~330ms short recovery, neither a guaranteed timing bound.\nReset/USB recovery requires hardware rail qualification, not a firmware delay." (at 20.32 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid f02bed20-b1a9-5d51-bf0e-e4aaad9ae5f0))
